  "name": "A Note from Cipher",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/A_Note_from_Cipher",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-18T08:35:01.727Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To Gray Mystery:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-54b9bfe17f8bd9c2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hey! This should be the last phantom thief letter I'll ever send you!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"When you receive a phantom thief letter, be prepared to lose something.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You're ready for that, aren't you?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-62744f6f4a167e8d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But don't worry!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "No need to guard your pockets or frantically check your bags. I'm not here to steal."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I'm here for our final \"split of the spoils.\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-4bcd8b80ecef6870"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This lucky cat coin has been by my side during every heist."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "No matter what tight spot I'm in, just holding it turns my luck from woe to weal."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Regardless of what weighs on my mind, tossing it up and catching it makes my steps mysteriously lighter."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f3da7c9cef6dc1a2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I've long seen that you also keep quite a bit of \"Trickery\" in your heart."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Otherwise, how could you have deceived destiny and stolen from the future?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "So, I'll entrust this \"stolen article\" to you."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "May it help you dodge every misfortune and obtain everything you desire."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-24b7e4df8ee78453"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sincerely, Kitty Phantom Thief"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a36f32ba37ff7732"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
